<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike cut by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it removed Nike Inc from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said now rates the stock as &quot;market outperform.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Last week, Nike said it expects earnings for the fourth quarter ending May 31 to be between $0.51 a share and $0.56 a share, below the Wall Street consensus estimate of $0.69 a share. Nike said the earnings will include a one-time, pretax charge equal to $0.04 a share.</p>
<p>-- Nike lost 3/4 to 56-1/4.</p>
</text>
